# Store sources (docs/STORE-SOURCES.md):
#  - Flathub: flatpak (per-user installs, no root) and the desktop portals that Flatpak apps use for file
#    dialogs, opening links and the light/dark preference (xdg-desktop-portal-gtk reads the GSettings
#    color-scheme that the shell sets through gsettings + dconf).
#  - Ubuntu catalogue: appstream makes apt download the DEP-11 metadata (Components-*.yml.gz) that
#    aurora-admin checks before installing a package that is not in the curated catalog; python3-yaml
#    parses that metadata for the Store's catalogue cache.
flatpak
xdg-desktop-portal
xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
appstream
python3-yaml
libglib2.0-bin
dconf-gsettings-backend
dconf-service
